                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 14457/69.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-04-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 18,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs informs me that diplomatic relations have been
                    resumed with the Netherlands.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
